doi: "10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX"

abstract: >
  Complete Python pipeline for SCAPS-1D simulation parsing, machine learning
  surrogate training (Random Forest, XGBoost, ANN), Gaussian Process Bayesian
  Optimisation (Matérn 5/2 + Expected Improvement), and SHAP explainability
  analysis applied to CaZrSe3/CdZnS chalcogenide perovskite solar cells.
  Achieves 95% reduction in SCAPS evaluations while finding the exact global
  PCE optimum (10.4927%).

keywords:
